# Four classes whose local names share a prefix (#226): a selection by substring picks the
# neighbours of Cat; a selection by equality picks Cat alone.
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/pets#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

<http://example.org/pets> a owl:Ontology .
ex:Cat a owl:Class .
ex:Category a owl:Class .
ex:Catalogue a owl:Class .
ex:Dog a owl:Class .
